### ProjectFlow API Testing File (REST Client / VS Code / Postman)
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### ========================================================
### 1. AUTH MODULE (টোকেন তৈরি করার জন্য)
### ========================================================

### 1.1 Register Student
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rahim Ahmed",
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "STUDENT"
}

### 1.2 Login as Student (টোকেন কপি করুন)
# @name studentLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 1.3 Register Mentor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dr. Kamal Mentor",
  "email": "mentor@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "MENTOR"
}

### 1.4 Login as Mentor (টোকেন কপি করুন)
# @name mentorLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mentor@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### ========================================================
### 2. SUBMISSION MODULE (STUDENT ACTIONS)
### ========================================================

### 2.1 Submit a Project (Student Action)
# আপনার student login থেকে পাওয়া accessToken এখানে বসান
@studentToken = {{studentLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectName": "E-Commerce Fullstack Platform",
  "frontendRepoUrl": "https://github.com/example/ecommerce-frontend",
  "backendRepoUrl": "https://github.com/example/ecommerce-backend",
  "liveLink": "https://ecommerce-demo.vercel.app",
  "description": "A fullstack e-commerce application built with Next.js, Express, and PostgreSQL."
}

### 2.2 Get My Submissions (Student Action)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/my
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}


### ========================================================
### 3. SUBMISSION MODULE (MENTOR ACTIONS)
### ========================================================

### মেন্টর টোকেন
@mentorToken = {{mentorLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 3.1 Get Dashboard Statistics (Mentor Action)
# মোট PENDING, APPROVED, REJECTED এবং TOTAL সংখ্যা
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{mentorToken}}

### 3.2 Get All Submissions (Default: page=1, limit=10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{mentorToken}}

### 3.3 Get All Submissions with Pagination & Status Filtering
# Status filter: PENDING | APPROVED | REJECTED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions?page=1&limit=5&status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{mentorToken}}

### 3.4 Update Submission Status (Mentor Action)
# :id এর জায়গায় ডাটাবেজের সাবমিশন id বসান
@submissionId = your-submission-uuid-here

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{submissionId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{mentorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "APPROVED"
}

### 3.5 Reject Submission Status (Mentor Action)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{submissionId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{mentorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "REJECTED"
}
